## 1e14e3a ← 94b0c45  (2026-09-21)

Added `EVAL_REASONING_EFFORT` (gpt-* only), which forwards
`--api-kwargs '{"reasoning_effort": …}'` and names the artifact slug
`__reasoning_<effort>`. GPT rows are only comparable across commits at the same
effort; the default stays `medium` from the committed GPT config.

## 94b0c45 ← a0c2997  (2026-09-21)

Fixed BrowserGym returning the unscaled screenshot after a no-op action. This
moves API numbers substantially — `gpt-5.5` goes `0.6240` → `0.8480` — so no
MiniWoB number from before this commit is comparable with one after it.

## a0c2997 ← 3f90798  (2026-09-21)

Accepted `EVAL_ENABLE_THINKING=true` for the Qwen3.8 family, which the
`3f90798` runner rejected. Qwen3.8 thinking rows land in a `think_xhigh` slug.

## 3f90798 ← 9685915  (2026-09-21)

Allowed `EVAL_ENABLE_THINKING=true` in `default` mode, not just `text_only`.
Thinking runs add the fixed override
`--agent-kwargs '{"enable_thinking": true, "sampling_kwargs": {"max_new_tokens": 4096}}'`
and land in a `__think_on` slug, so they never resume a non-thinking run.

## 9685915 (2026-09-13)

Added MiniWoB default runner/config coverage for Qwen3.8, UI-TARS-1.5,
EvoCUA, and UI-Venus-2 model families. Default runs use the existing
browsergym.miniwob task set (125 tasks) through the remote env-server path.

## f57d3cb  (2026-07-02)

Initial standardized snapshot at this commit; no predecessor entry. MiniWoB
(125 tasks) runs as a single stateless fully-parallel pass via
`devs/exps/eval/browsergym.miniwob/run.sh`; default mode is `default.yaml`
(screenshot + coord), with `text_only.yaml` (AXTree bid-mode) selectable via
`EVAL_MODE=text_only`.
